   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "My ... hurts",
     "texto": [
      "**У меня** shows who feels the pain. The body part is the subject and is in the nominative; the verb agrees with it: **болит** with a singular body part (**голова**) and **болят** with a plural form (**глаза**). **У меня болит голова** («My head hurts»), **У меня болят глаза** («My eyes hurt»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Instructions",
     "texto": [
      "**Принимайте таблетку три раза в день**: **принимайте** is the formal imperative of **принимать** (you, plural) and is used for a repeated instruction. **Отдыхайте** is also a formal imperative: «rest». **Раз** means «time»: **один раз**, **два раза**, **три раза**; **в день** means «a day»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
